Z||000000||gangrenefiero||08-23-2001||09:10 PM||||There was a movie on the WGN network thursday night at 8 thats called "The Wraith". It has Dennis Quaid and Charlie Sheen in it and its about street racers. And there is this phantom car that goes around getting revenge for his death caused by the gang. Anyway to the Fiero, this phantom car is very similar to that 89 prototype especially in the front. It has a mid mounted engine and even that little scoop on the side in the door. its not exact of course but its really close. If youve seen the movie, say what you think or watch for it or got rent it!<BR>Mike<BR>Gangrenefiero||||reg||5
